sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as Employee
    participant GW as Front Door + APIM
    participant ID as Entra ID / OIDC
    participant API as AI service /ask
    participant CA as Redis cache
    participant IGD as Input guard
    participant VDB as Vector DB + BM25
    participant RR as Reranker
    participant LLM as Model endpoint
    participant GC as Grounding check
    participant OBS as Logs and metrics

    U->>GW: POST /ask, question, bearer token
    GW->>ID: validate token, read group claims
    ID-->>GW: identity + ACL groups
    GW->>API: forward with x-request-id and ACL groups

    API->>CA: lookup question hash + corpus version + ACL
    alt Cache hit
        CA-->>API: cached verified answer
        API-->>U: 200, answer, sources, cached true
    else Cache miss
        API->>IGD: screen question
        alt Injection or confidential request
            IGD-->>API: blocked, reason prompt_injection
            API->>OBS: log refusal, question hash only
            API-->>U: 200, refusal sentence, answered_from_context false
        else Allowed
            IGD-->>API: sanitised question
            par Parallel retrieval
                API->>VDB: dense search, ACL and domain prefilter
            and
                API->>VDB: BM25 search, same filters
            end
            VDB-->>API: 50 candidates, RRF fused
            alt Best score below relevance threshold
                API->>OBS: log no_relevant_context
                API-->>U: 200, refusal sentence, no model call
            else Relevant
                API->>RR: rerank 50 candidates
                RR-->>API: top 8 chunks
                API->>API: context guard strips untrusted instructions
                API->>LLM: system prompt + numbered context, JSON mode
                LLM-->>API: sufficient, answer, citations
                API->>GC: validate citations, numbers, lexical support
                alt Ungrounded figure
                    GC-->>API: ungrounded_numbers
                    API->>LLM: one bounded regeneration with correction
                    LLM-->>API: corrected JSON
                    API->>GC: re-assess
                end
                alt Grounding or output guard fails
                    GC-->>API: reject, low_groundedness or output_blocked
                    API->>OBS: log rejection reason and scores
                    API-->>U: 200, refusal sentence
                else Passes
                    GC-->>API: valid citations, support score
                    API->>CA: store verified answer under composite key
                    API->>OBS: log latency, sources, confidence, cost
                    API-->>U: 200, answer, citations, confidence, request_id
                end
            end
        end
    end
